(5, 'Golden Jubilee Countdown: Fifty Years of Humble Family Service (1976 – 2026)', 'Generalate Council', '2026-10-15', 'As our beloved congregation approaches its 50th Anniversary on November 21, 2026, we look back with heartfelt gratitude to God''s divine providence.
